        "eyeline": "phone -> door opening f0-4 -> the glovebox from f10 to the cut",
        "face": "f0-9 readable three-quarter: brows level and very slightly lifted (the question), mouth soft; then hesitation becoming focused calm, read in stillness, breath and the forearms; no comic expression",
        "keys": [
          {
            "f": 0,
            "pose": "head only about one sixth turned toward the open door (about 20 deg of the ~115 deg turn from south to the glovebox, west-north-west), so the face is about 60 deg off the lens: three-quarter, both eyes and brows read; eyes just lifted off the phone and sliding screen left (eyes lead, f0-2)",
